## Engineering evidence

- [Analysis index](Analysis/README.md) contains generated audits, readiness
  reports, and validation evidence. These are engineering records rather than a
  stable public API reference.
- [Research index](Research/README.md) contains design notes, API maps, and
  known-boundary investigations. Research documents do not imply that a tool is
  release-ready.
